<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 5: Rescue Scenario &mdash; Unconscious Casualty</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">Critical competencies: effective tow and safe extrication.</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="ru_recognition_and_alert">Recognition and alert?</label>
